      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신, 어떤 타입 포켓몬의 팬이야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0002C0020C5B4B5A40020D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020D32CC774C57C003F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "난 의심할 여지 없는\n페어리타입 팬!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B09C0020C758C2ECD5600020C5ECC9C00020C5C6B294000AD398C5B4B9ACD0C0C7850020D32C002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 옷은 유명한 페어리타입 전문가가\n디자인한 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C637C7400020C720BA85D55C0020D398C5B4B9ACD0C0C7850020C804BB38AC00AC00000AB514C790C778D55C0020AC70C57C002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 그분과 센스가 통하는 나도\n페어리 팬인 게 당연하잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020ADF8BD84ACFC0020C13CC2A4AC000020D1B5D558B2940020B098B3C4000AD398C5B4B9AC0020D32CC7780020AC8C0020B2F9C5F0D558C796C544002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지! 너와 나의 좋아하는 타입 중에\n어느 쪽이 승부에서 더 강한지 확인해 볼래?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C000210020B108C6400020B098C7580020C88BC544D558B2940020D0C0C7850020C911C5D0000AC5B4B2900020CABDC7740020C2B9BD80C5D0C11C0020B3540020AC15D55CC9C00020D655C778D5740020BCFCB798003F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어느 쪽 타입이 더 강한지 겨뤄 보고 싶다면\n내게 말을 걸어 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B2900020CABD0020D0C0C785C7740020B3540020AC15D55CC9C00020ACA8B9040020BCF4ACE00020C2F6B2E4BA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "난 페어리타입 팬이야!\n내가 좋아하는 포켓몬들과 승부해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B09C0020D398C5B4B9ACD0C0C7850020D32CC774C57C0021000AB0B4AC000020C88BC544D558B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC0020C2B9BD80D5740020C918002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아하는 타입으로 잘 준비하고 와.\n여러 타입으로 싸워도 괜찮아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544D558B2940020D0C0C785C73CB85C0020C7980020C900BE44D558ACE00020C640002E000AC5ECB7EC0020D0C0C785C73CB85C0020C2F8C6CCB3C40020AD1CCC2EC544002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 바로 시작하자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020BC14B85C0020C2DCC791D558C790002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 타입의 기술은\n페어리타입에게 효과가 없기도 해.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n네가 과연 알고 있으려나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020D0C0C785C7580020AE30C220C740000AD398C5B4B9ACD0C0C785C5D0AC8C0020D6A8ACFCAC000020C5C6AE30B3C40020D574002E00100001BE00000AB124AC000020ACFCC5F00020C54CACE00020C788C73CB824B098003F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하아... 아쉽다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C544002E002E002E0020C544C27DB2E4002E00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "페어리타입에게\n드래곤타입의 공격은 효과가 없어.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그런 굉장한 아이들인데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D398C5B4B9ACD0C0C785C5D0AC8C000AB4DCB798ACE4D0C0C785C7580020ACF5ACA9C7400020D6A8ACFCAC000020C5C6C5B4002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7F00020AD49C7A5D55C0020C544C774B4E4C778B370002E002E002E00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...뭐, 당연히\n상성이 나쁜 타입도 있지만 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EBB50002C0020B2F9C5F0D788000AC0C1C131C7740020B098C05C0020D0C0C785B3C40020C788C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "특정 타입으로 통일해서 사용하면\n약점 타입도 치우치기 마련이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B9C8150020D0C0C785C73CB85C0020D1B5C77CD574C11C0020C0ACC6A9D558BA74000AC57DC8100020D0C0C785B3C40020CE58C6B0CE58AE300020B9C8B828C774C57C002E00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래도 변함없이 계속 좋아할 거야!\n타입 팬이란 건 그런 거니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798B3C40020BCC0D568C5C6C7740020ACC4C18D0020C88BC544D5600020AC70C57C0021000AD0C0C7850020D32CC774B7800020AC740020ADF8B7F00020AC70B2C8AE4C002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
